load @term/seed/code/group/homomorphism
  find group-homomorphism

# A group automorphism: an invertible endomorphism, a structure-preserving self-map with a structure-preserving inverse,
# a symmetry of the group itself. The automorphisms form a group under composition. The automorphism group of the
# octonions is the exceptional Lie group G2, the source of the substrate's internal symmetry. The form carries the
# underlying self-homomorphism; invertibility is the added condition.
form group-automorphism
  link map, like group-homomorphism
